		(property "Key Specs" "VIN 3-36 V; VOUT 1-16 V adjustable; IOUT max 6 A; fsw 200 kHz-2.2 MHz set by RT; current-mode, spread spectrum; peak efficiency >95%; Tj -40 to 125 C"
			(at 115.57 86.36 0)
